From: mscharged-port
Subject: Expose FIFO-ordered evidence of actual encoded GX draws
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

An encoded receipt is distinct from application submission and presentation.
Cold or failed pipelines return without recording one. Native movie ownership
combines the exact private tag with actual successful surface presentation and
frame drain before admitting completion. No rendering equations are changed.

diff --git a/include/dolphin/gx/GXAurora.h b/include/dolphin/gx/GXAurora.h
